"""Auto-generated gRPC stubs for the A2A proto.

This directory is populated by ``proto/regen.sh`` (or the adapter Dockerfile
build step, which calls the same protoc invocation).  Don't edit the
generated files by hand.

When gRPC stubs are missing — e.g. ``grpcio-tools`` not installed — the
files won't exist and :mod:`agent_mesh_common.a2a.grpc_server` falls back
to a no-op stub so the adapter still boots with REST/JSON-RPC only.
"""
